# Reproduction-only import attempt for the REx86 LoRA published with
# https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.20975. This does not create a model with Ollama
# 0.32.0: Qwen is absent from that release's supported Safetensors adapter
# architectures. Keep the file so the compatibility result can be reproduced
# and re-tested after an Ollama upgrade. Place the adapter beside this file as
# REx86/adapter_model.safetensors before running `ollama create`.
#
# The paper trained against the *base* Qwen2.5-Coder-7B checkpoint, not the
# instruct model. Do not silently switch bases: Ollama documents mismatched
# adapters as undefined behaviour.
FROM qwen2.5-coder:7b-base-q4_K_M
ADAPTER REx86/adapter_model.safetensors
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0
